    "flavor_text_entries": [
      {
        "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon a été créé de toutes pièces il y a 500 ans. Il comprend ce qu’on lui dit, mais il n’est pas doué de parole.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "This artificial Pokémon, constructed more than 500 years ago, can understand human speech but cannot itself speak.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "５００年以上前に　造られた 人造ポケモン。　人の　言葉を 理解するが　しゃべれない。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Son corps mécanique n’est qu’une enveloppe. Sa véritable nature est une âme artificielle nommée Animacœur.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Its mechanized body is merely a vessel. Its true self is its Soul-Heart, an artificial soul.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "機械仕掛けの　身体は　ただの 器。　ソウルハートと　呼ばれる 人造の　魂が　本体。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il accède à la conscience des individus en se synchronisant avec eux. Cette faculté l’aide à prendre soin d’eux.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It synchronizes its consciousness with others to understand their feelings. This faculty makes it useful for taking care of people.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "意識を　同調させて　相手の 気持ちを　理解。　人の　お世話を するのに　便利な　能力。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il a été créé par un scientifique il y a environ 500 ans de cela. Sa véritable essence est un organe nommé Animacœur.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Built roughly 500 years ago by a scientist, the part called the Soul-Heart is the actual life-form.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "およそ　５００年前　科学者に よって　作られた。　ソウルハートと 呼ばれる　パーツが　本体なのだ。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
